## CWV (deploy lead only — Prabhjas)

Label `cwv-wave`. Baseline Lighthouse before code. One tier at a time (LCP → fonts/CLS → JS → CSS → legacy WP). Revert if regression. No `*-v2` cache busting. See `docs/developers/CWV-WAVE-PROMPT.md`.

Developers: CWV-safe habits only — `docs/developers/DEVELOPER-CLEAN-CODE.md`.

---

## Deploy lead only (Prabhjas — four gates)

See `docs/developers/DEPLOY-LEAD-FLOW.md`. Never collapse into one silent publish.

1. **Intake** (local cherry-pick) → Intake Summary → stop for `ok`
2. **Dual-push** `work/astro-sites` origin + personal → Push Summary → stop for `test it`
3. **Test gate** (check/build, fleet-local, routes, Lighthouse for CWV) → Test Summary → Ready for Release → stop for `ok all perfect`
4. **Aaron path** only on `push via Aaron path` → live verify → **RELEASED**

Always create/reuse a Prabhjas `deploy-wave` ticket per wave; create brand tickets if developers missed them.
